{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paper Knight is a <strong>2.5D fantasy platformer</strong> set in a <strong>beautiful world of crafts</strong>, which will tell the legend of Sant Jordi! Make your way with a sword, jump over obstacles and overcome all levels and enemies to save the kingdom from the evils that hide in the shadows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a hand-made and beautiful paper aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the legends of Catalonia from a new perspective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through and complete hand-crafted levels and various challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ hours of adventure, twists and turns.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643610?t=1773995558","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643610?t=1773995558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643610/de73a60ce2ea3098ce502dff967e931835f57a98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773995558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643610/de73a60ce2ea3098ce502dff967e931835f57a98/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773995558","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4481660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paper Knight is a <strong>2.5D fantasy platformer</strong> set in a <strong>beautiful world of crafts</strong>, which will tell the legend of Sant Jordi! Make your way with a sword, jump over obstacles and overcome all levels and enemies to save the kingdom from the evils that hide in the shadows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap